{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## AC1's PLATFORM QUESTION IS ANSWERED: the Epic Link write WORKS, and my predicted failure did NOT occur\n\nCapability-map run **30863672922**:\n\n    Epic SCRUM-1 created (with Epic Name).\n    PUT /rest/api/2/issue/SCRUM-2 {\"fields\":{\"customfield_10001\":\"SCRUM-1\"}} -> HTTP 204  [req-0040]\n    GET SCRUM-2?fields=customfield_10001 -> \"SCRUM-1\"                                     [req-0041]\n\n**Writing the instance-discovered Epic Link on a child DOES take effect and round-trips.** So change\n1311's mechanism is sound on DC 8.17.1 — the approach that replaced 1302's refuted greenhopper route\nis correct.\n\n**And the failure I predicted before the run did NOT happen.** I recorded that the likeliest failure\nwas the Epic Link not being on the child's EDIT screen, presenting as HTTP 400 \"not on the\nappropriate screen\". The map confirms **Epic Link is indeed NOT on the default edit screen**\n(`epic_link_on_standard_edit_screen: False`, req-0034) — **yet the raw REST PUT still succeeded and\npersisted.** Screen presence did not gate the API write. My prediction had the right mechanism and\nthe wrong consequence, and it is worth recording that screen configuration does not block REST\nwrites on this version, because that assumption would otherwise have shaped the 3fe5 provisioning\nwork unnecessarily.\n\nAlso resolved: `Epic Link = customfield_10001`, `Epic Name = customfield_10003`, and **all three\nsoftware templates yield an Epic issue type** — so [rebar:3fe5-c22e-dc2d-4c9e] is a solvable\nprovisioning change, not a platform limit.\n\n**AC1 still needs the harness cell to EXECUTE** before it is ticked. The platform question is\nanswered; the pass-level assertion is not. That distinction is the whole discipline of this epic and\nI am not collapsing it here."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785803179621221001,"uuid":"7051ec11-3513-4327-b7b9-90e6a1b24977"}